        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Document Chrome's deprecation of the unload event and its alternatives]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45681</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45681"/>
        <updated>2026-09-13T19:27:31.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18045464?u=54fa64de86eaa92044c02e3f0707962fa2300ab7&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Updates the "Usage notes" on the <code class="notranslate">Window: unload event</code> page to explain Chrome's gradual change to stop running <code class="notranslate">unload</code> listeners, document the <code class="notranslate">unload</code> Permissions-Policy directive (<code class="notranslate">unload=*</code> / <code class="notranslate">unload=()</code>), and show how to migrate from <code class="notranslate">unload</code> to <code class="notranslate">visibilitychange</code>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">As scoped in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5348560260" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45502" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/45502/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45502">#45502</a>, the page should explain why <code class="notranslate">unload</code> is being deprecated and document the alternatives. Readers weren't told that their <code class="notranslate">unload</code> listeners may already not run in Chrome, or how to opt in or out. The page also still referred to browsers that don't support <code class="notranslate">visibilitychange</code>, which no longer applies to modern browsers.</p>
<p dir="auto">The existing warning callout is kept and no deprecation status is added, since the BCD deprecation was reverted in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3582197900" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28364" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28364/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28364">mdn/browser-compat-data#28364</a>. The <code class="notranslate">visibilitychange</code>/<code class="notranslate">pagehide</code> wording is aligned with the review feedback on <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5117173593" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45081" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/45081/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45081">#45081</a>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Chrome's deprecation plan and timeline: <a href="https://developer.chrome.com/docs/web-platform/deprecating-unload" rel="nofollow">https://developer.chrome.com/docs/web-platform/deprecating-unload</a></li>
<li>Spec discussion: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="714605637" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/6026" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/whatwg/html/issues/6026/hovercard" href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/6026">whatwg/html#6026</a></li>
<li>The new example mirrors the existing <code class="notranslate">sendBeacon()</code> example on the <code class="notranslate">visibilitychange</code> page.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">AI disclosure: I used an AI assistant (Claude) to help research and draft this change. I reviewed the text and verified it against the sources above.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #45502.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5348560260" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45502" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/45502/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45502">#45502</a><br>
Relates to <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5117173593" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45081" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/45081/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45081">#45081</a></p>]]></content>
