        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45652"/>
        <updated>2026-09-12T14:42:49.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185269030?u=1fc22565ccf4566b6f734fabaa87e03d9a31cfe4&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h2 dir="auto">Summary</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Clarify that the <code class="notranslate">Color renderable</code> column in <code class="notranslate">texImage2D()</code> describes WebGL 2 core support.</li>
<li>Document the additional floating-point renderability provided by <code class="notranslate">EXT_color_buffer_float</code> and <code class="notranslate">EXT_color_buffer_half_float</code>.</li>
<li>Clarify that <code class="notranslate">OES_texture_float</code> functionality for floating-point textures is core in WebGL 2, while floating-point color buffers require the appropriate extension.</li>
</ul>
